WEBVTT

00:00:04.810 --> 00:00:06.650
I'm back.

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:13.500
Welcome home, Sagara-san.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:15.700
I apologize for being so late, Satou-san.

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:19.060
Did anything happen while I was out?

00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:20.660
No, nothing special.

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:23.930
Is something the matter?

00:00:23.930 --> 00:00:25.280
Oh, nothing.

00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:27.640
I was just wondering if we had a visitor.

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:31.700
Oh, yes! Izumi-san's friend 
is here right now.

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:35.630
I believe Ichihara-san is 
taking them some food.

00:00:35.630 --> 00:00:36.890
Friend?

00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:38.960
It's nice to see, isn't it?

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:42.280
This is the first time he's 
had a friend over, I believe.

00:00:43.610 --> 00:00:44.840
Yes, it is.

00:00:45.890 --> 00:00:47.980
You can head back in.

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:49.870
Thank you.

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:51.060
All right.

00:00:57.330 --> 00:00:59.290
<i>So he has a friend.</i>

00:00:59.290 --> 00:01:02.160
<i>And a friend who wears 
expensive shoes, at that.</i>

00:01:04.870 --> 00:01:06.540
Sagara-san!

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:07.630
Good morning!

00:01:07.840 --> 00:01:09.000
Ichijou Ryouma—

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:10.870
...san?

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:12.820
W-Why are you here?

00:01:12.820 --> 00:01:15.430
I came over to assist Izumi-kun for a bit.

00:01:16.550 --> 00:01:18.890
Oh, sorry! I'm in a hurry right now.

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:20.430
Please excuse me.

00:01:21.290 --> 00:01:22.500
Thank you for having me!

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:25.980
<i>He came over to assist?</i>

00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:27.730
<i>With what?</i>

00:01:28.810 --> 00:01:29.980
<i>Don't tell me!</i>

00:03:04.030 --> 00:03:04.870
Izumi-san!

00:03:04.870 --> 00:03:06.870
<b><i>What Kind Of Test Is That?</i></b>

00:03:10.470 --> 00:03:11.830
<i>He's asleep.</i>

00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:15.750
<b>Angel Heart</b>

00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:15.750
<b>The Holy War Between Angels and Demons!!</b>

00:03:13.550 --> 00:03:16.960
<i>As I feared, Izumi really did 
make him help make his manga.</i>

00:03:16.960 --> 00:03:19.300
<b>SCHWING</b>

00:03:17.270 --> 00:03:19.650
<i>He used Ichijou Ryouma, the superstar,</i>

00:03:19.650 --> 00:03:21.680
<i>to make this crap!</i>

00:03:21.970 --> 00:03:24.300
What a waste of his talents!

00:03:26.160 --> 00:03:29.980
<i>Though, the second half is a lot 
better than the first...</i>

00:03:29.980 --> 00:03:32.230
<b>The assistant is better than the artist                                         He's talented, that one.</b>

00:03:30.250 --> 00:03:32.230
Was this Ryouma's work?

00:03:32.230 --> 00:03:35.360
I did it... my debut...

00:03:35.680 --> 00:03:39.220
Ryouma... thank you...

00:03:42.780 --> 00:03:44.280
<i>That said...</i>

00:03:44.570 --> 00:03:47.410
<i>He managed to get Izumi, who is 
difficult just to become friends with,</i>

00:03:47.610 --> 00:03:49.470
<i>to let him into his room...</i>

00:03:52.320 --> 00:03:56.040
<i>You're better than I gave you 
credit for, Ichijou Ryouma.</i>

00:03:58.530 --> 00:03:59.380
Ryouma-san!

00:03:59.640 --> 00:04:00.910
I've been waiting for you!

00:04:00.910 --> 00:04:01.780
Where's the company president?

00:04:01.780 --> 00:04:02.680
In his office.

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:04.590
Got it. I'll be back.

00:04:07.890 --> 00:04:09.980
Sir? It's Ichijou Ryouma.

00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:11.930
Please come in.

00:04:12.460 --> 00:04:15.100
I apologize for keeping you wait—

00:04:15.550 --> 00:04:16.730
You're friggin' late!

00:04:16.730 --> 00:04:19.910
How many hours were you planning 
to keep me waiting, huh?

00:04:19.910 --> 00:04:20.620
Uh...

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:23.360
It's only been about 40 minutes.

00:04:23.730 --> 00:04:25.030
Shut up! Shut your piehole!

00:04:25.400 --> 00:04:26.860
Don't say one word back to me!

00:04:26.860 --> 00:04:31.350
You've had some serious attitude lately, kid.
 Just because you're bringin' in some cash!

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:34.980
Well, what do you have to
 say for yourself? Speak up!

00:04:34.980 --> 00:04:37.030
You told me not to 
say one word back to you.

00:04:37.030 --> 00:04:39.240
What was that?! How dare 
you be so cocky, you—

00:04:39.240 --> 00:04:41.210
"Miserable nobody Ryouma"?

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:43.640
How dare you steal my line?!

00:04:43.640 --> 00:04:46.090
Mr. President, remember the issue at hand.

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:47.850
That's right!

00:04:48.920 --> 00:04:52.600
Ryouma, I called you here today 
for one reason alone.

00:04:54.120 --> 00:04:55.360
Take a look at these!

00:04:58.130 --> 00:04:58.900
<i>This was from the other day...</i>

00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:00.900
<i>When did they...?</i>

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:05.740
That's the girl who did the <i>Happy Wedding</i> 
commercial with you, isn't it?

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:06.680
Damn it!

00:05:06.680 --> 00:05:08.910
Are you an idiot, letting yourself 
get photographed so blatantly?!

00:05:09.400 --> 00:05:12.440
The gossip mag <i>Saturday </i>
sent us a heads-up that

00:05:12.440 --> 00:05:15.370
they're running these photos and 
an article in this week's issue.

00:05:15.810 --> 00:05:19.840
We're preparing to negotiate with them 
to bury the pictures, of course.

00:05:20.480 --> 00:05:24.550
Though negotiating will essentially tell them
 we acknowledge what's in the pictures.

00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:28.510
So before all that, I want to hear 
what you've got to say about this.

00:05:29.400 --> 00:05:32.710
What kind of relationship 
do you have with this girl?

00:05:34.230 --> 00:05:36.710
<i>What kind of relationship 
do I have with Izumi?</i>

00:05:37.760 --> 00:05:39.220
Um...

00:05:39.820 --> 00:05:40.990
Friends?

00:05:40.990 --> 00:05:44.280
Or actually, more like 
texting buddies? I guess...

00:05:44.280 --> 00:05:45.400
You scum!

00:05:45.720 --> 00:05:47.570
You're even lying to me?!

00:05:47.960 --> 00:05:49.280
She's your girlfriend, isn't she?!

00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:50.990
N-No! You're totally wrong!

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:53.380
How am I wrong, you damned twit?!

00:05:53.380 --> 00:05:54.700
Well, Izumi isn't even a—

00:05:56.240 --> 00:05:59.790
<i>Wait a sec. Is it okay to 
reveal that Izumi's a guy?</i>

00:06:00.720 --> 00:06:03.420
Excuse me for one moment. 
I need to confirm something.

00:06:03.770 --> 00:06:05.170
Hey! Get back here!

00:06:05.170 --> 00:06:07.850
Bastard! I'm still talking 
to you, do you hear?!

00:06:07.580 --> 00:06:10.890
Mr. President, please don't 
stand on top of your desk.

00:06:07.850 --> 00:06:09.480
Don't think you can get away 
with whatever you want!

00:06:09.480 --> 00:06:10.890
Hello? Sagara-san?

00:06:11.250 --> 00:06:14.520
What? Paparazzi photos? In <i>Saturday</i>?

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:17.300
<i>Yes. I'm truly sorry about this.</i>

00:06:17.300 --> 00:06:19.650
<i>So that really was a paparazzi van...</i>

00:06:21.610 --> 00:06:23.230
I see.

00:06:23.230 --> 00:06:27.820
<i>And so, I was wondering how much I 
could tell my company about Izumi...</i>

00:06:28.650 --> 00:06:29.660
I understand.

00:06:30.540 --> 00:06:32.910
I'll head over straight away.

00:06:34.610 --> 00:06:36.330
<i>Izumi-kun! Good morning!</i>

00:06:36.650 --> 00:06:40.040
<i>Go out there and do your best 
today! Love-love, Lala-Lulu!</i>

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:42.920
<i>Izumi-kun! Good morning!</i>

00:06:46.520 --> 00:06:48.220
Ahh, I slept so well!

00:06:48.220 --> 00:06:51.800
To Izumi
 I have to take care of something, 
so I'm heading out. —Ryouma 
P.S. I'll text you later

00:06:48.900 --> 00:06:51.800
Huh? Ryouma left already?

00:06:52.090 --> 00:06:54.610
Looks like he really did push 
himself to come help me.

00:06:55.650 --> 00:06:57.180
I'll have to send him a thank-you text later.

00:06:59.370 --> 00:07:02.630
<i>Thanks to Ryouma's help, 
I actually finished it!</i>

00:07:02.630 --> 00:07:04.020
<i>A work I can truly be proud of!</i>

00:07:04.480 --> 00:07:05.230
<i>All right!</i>

00:07:05.230 --> 00:07:07.940
<i>It's time to take Kadoyama Shoten 
by storm with this submission!</i>

00:07:08.370 --> 00:07:09.990
Hold it right there!

00:07:10.350 --> 00:07:12.080
Izumi-san, I have great news!

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:15.450
We're holding a press conference this Saturday 
and making your show biz debut!

00:07:17.870 --> 00:07:20.620
<b>BLANK</b>

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:18.800
Huh?

00:07:19.360 --> 00:07:20.620
Didn't you hear me?

00:07:21.140 --> 00:07:23.360
You're debuting! This Saturday!

00:07:23.950 --> 00:07:25.670
What are you talking about?

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:26.960
Rei, are you still asleep?

00:07:27.570 --> 00:07:30.590
Ironically enough, I just pulled 
an all-nighter. I am not asleep.

00:07:31.020 --> 00:07:33.280
More importantly, please listen closely.

00:07:33.280 --> 00:07:34.810
The other day in Urasandou,

00:07:34.810 --> 00:07:37.140
some paparazzi took photos 
of you and Ryouma together.

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:37.760
Huh?

00:07:39.770 --> 00:07:41.730
<b>AAAARGH!</b>

00:07:41.990 --> 00:07:45.050
Negotiations to bury the story at 
<i>Saturday</i> magazine have broken down.

00:07:45.050 --> 00:07:46.040
At this rate,

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:49.380
the country will be in a frenzy over 
this "passionate love story scoop."

00:07:49.380 --> 00:07:50.400
Scoop?

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:54.570
The press is sure to dig up 
your true identity as a result.

00:07:56.280 --> 00:07:58.530
Wh-What should we do?

00:07:58.530 --> 00:08:00.430
That's why we need to act first

00:08:00.430 --> 00:08:03.560
and hold a press conference!

00:08:03.560 --> 00:08:05.550
If we explain that you are a boy,

00:08:05.550 --> 00:08:06.920
we'll be able to head off 
any talk of scandal as well.

00:08:07.200 --> 00:08:08.160
And then!

00:08:08.160 --> 00:08:10.740
If we top it off with the announcement that

00:08:10.740 --> 00:08:13.170
the famed Sena family's youngest child 
Sena Izumi is finally making his debut,

00:08:13.170 --> 00:08:15.250
the press will flock to that story instead!

00:08:15.250 --> 00:08:16.750
Hold on a sec.

00:08:16.750 --> 00:08:19.800
I get why we need to hold 
a press conference, but...

00:08:19.800 --> 00:08:22.060
Why do I have to make 
my show biz debut, too?

00:08:24.080 --> 00:08:24.890
Tch.

00:08:24.890 --> 00:08:26.550
Did you just click your tongue?

00:08:26.360 --> 00:08:27.110
<b>He did!</b>

00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:27.110
<b>I heard it!</b>

00:08:27.720 --> 00:08:31.070
Izumi-san! This is a 
once-in-a-lifetime chance!

00:08:31.800 --> 00:08:33.710
The press will all be gathered.

00:08:33.710 --> 00:08:37.070
You couldn't make a grander debut than this!

00:08:37.070 --> 00:08:38.910
Like I keep saying...

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:41.480
I want to debut as a manga artist!

00:08:41.480 --> 00:08:43.960
I'm heading to <i>Kadoyama Shoten</i> right now

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:46.120
to hand in my ultimate awesome manuscript!

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:47.600
Who knows?

00:08:47.600 --> 00:08:51.170
They might decide to give me the Kadoyama 
Manga Prize right then and there!

00:08:53.650 --> 00:08:54.840
<i>Calm down, Rei.</i>

00:08:54.840 --> 00:08:58.800
<b>RUMBLE RUMBLE</b>

00:08:55.230 --> 00:08:57.000
Yes, there is plenty you want to say,

00:08:57.000 --> 00:08:58.800
but you have to remain calm.

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:01.320
A super-fast win! A super-fast debut!

00:09:02.230 --> 00:09:03.820
I understand.

00:09:03.820 --> 00:09:06.180
If you're that confident,

00:09:06.180 --> 00:09:07.820
why don't we make a deal?

00:09:09.060 --> 00:09:10.840
If that piece-of-trash manga 
gets a favorable review,

00:09:10.840 --> 00:09:12.290
you can make your 
manga artist debut!

00:09:12.290 --> 00:09:15.240
But if not, you will do as I say 
and make your show biz debut!

00:09:15.240 --> 00:09:16.990
P-P-Piece-of-trash manga?!

00:09:17.510 --> 00:09:18.950
What do you say?

00:09:19.260 --> 00:09:22.160
Fine, then. I accept your challenge.

00:09:22.900 --> 00:09:23.930
Just you watch me!

00:09:23.930 --> 00:09:26.980
I'll make you eat your words later!

00:09:27.680 --> 00:09:29.170
No, you won't.

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:32.670
<i>Magical Spiral-lulu!</i>

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:41.980
You did it-tee!

00:09:41.980 --> 00:09:43.600
Great job, Lala-Lulu!

00:09:44.240 --> 00:09:45.810
Thank you, Shanti!

00:09:46.460 --> 00:09:48.690
You seem to have gotten a <i>little</i> stronger.

00:09:49.470 --> 00:09:50.650
Lala-Lulu!

00:10:03.810 --> 00:10:05.120
Gaga-Ruru!

00:10:05.640 --> 00:10:09.000
You look as foolish as ever, Shanti!

00:10:10.160 --> 00:10:12.290
Y-You're...

00:10:13.360 --> 00:10:14.300
...Green Bean?

00:10:15.560 --> 00:10:17.550
The name's Biscuit! Biscuit!

00:10:17.550 --> 00:10:19.390
Don't you dare give me a weird nickname!

00:10:19.390 --> 00:10:20.430
Tee hee!

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:22.610
Gaga-Ruru...

00:10:23.090 --> 00:10:25.920
the reason I've gotten 
stronger is to save you!

00:10:25.920 --> 00:10:28.020
To return you to your former self!

00:10:30.190 --> 00:10:32.730
It seems you're still 
Little Miss Goody-Goody.

00:10:34.870 --> 00:10:37.070
<i>Magical Death Metal!</i>

00:10:38.560 --> 00:10:39.530
Lala-Lulu!

00:10:41.210 --> 00:10:43.010
Lala-Lulu...

00:10:43.010 --> 00:10:44.410
Excuse me.

00:10:46.340 --> 00:10:48.330
Are you Sena-kun?

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:50.540
Please accept this!

00:10:50.880 --> 00:10:53.340
I'd like to submit it to the 
Kadoyama Manga Prize Contest!

00:10:54.200 --> 00:10:55.480
I'll take a look.

00:10:55.480 --> 00:10:56.510
Please!

00:11:03.460 --> 00:11:04.960
<i>Too bad for Rei.</i>

00:11:04.960 --> 00:11:08.180
<i>I've got this challenge in the bag!</i>

00:11:08.560 --> 00:11:11.860
<i>All I need is a positive review, and I win!</i>

00:11:12.320 --> 00:11:14.240
<i>But it'll be more than a positive review.</i>

00:11:14.240 --> 00:11:16.280
<i>I have faith in this manga!</i>

00:11:16.800 --> 00:11:20.080
<i>Even if, in the worst case, 
I don't win the prize,</i>

00:11:20.080 --> 00:11:22.250
<i>I'm positive the editor will 
say he wants to work with me,</i>

00:11:22.250 --> 00:11:24.200
<i>and that I can debut 
with my next work!</i>

00:11:25.220 --> 00:11:25.950
Hey, you.

00:11:26.320 --> 00:11:27.240
Yes?

00:11:28.370 --> 00:11:29.480
What is this?

00:11:29.480 --> 00:11:30.040
Huh?

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:39.300
What?

00:11:39.760 --> 00:11:41.620
You drew this seriously?

00:11:42.020 --> 00:11:44.300
Then, I'm sorry, but you just 
don't have any talent for this.

00:11:44.760 --> 00:11:47.630
Nope. You don't have any hope in this field.

00:11:54.280 --> 00:11:55.430
<i>So I...</i>

00:11:55.880 --> 00:11:58.320
<i>don't have any talent in manga...</i>

00:11:59.130 --> 00:12:02.780
<i>And I don't have a single 
hope in that field...</i>

00:12:02.780 --> 00:12:04.910
<i>There's nothing left for me now...</i>

00:12:17.710 --> 00:12:18.750
I just...

00:12:20.460 --> 00:12:23.850
don't know what to do anymore...

00:12:32.890 --> 00:12:34.190
<i>He's late.</i>

00:12:36.810 --> 00:12:39.260
<i>Well, I'm sure he's just 
not ready to come home</i>

00:12:39.260 --> 00:12:41.360
<i>after being thoroughly told 
off by the manga people.</i>

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:45.860
<i>Maybe it was immature of me to say all that</i>

00:12:46.340 --> 00:12:48.580
<i>when it was obvious he would fail.</i>

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:49.580
<b>For crying out loud!</b>

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:49.620
<b>You're completely
 immature!</b>

00:12:49.680 --> 00:12:51.060
<i>No...</i>

00:12:51.060 --> 00:12:54.340
<i>sometimes it's good for you to taste 
the harshness of the real world!</i>

00:12:57.830 --> 00:13:00.590
<b>1 New Message</b>

00:12:58.280 --> 00:13:00.590
Ah, finally ready to come crying home?

00:13:00.590 --> 00:13:02.010
<b>From: Sena Izumi
Untitled

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:03.510
What?!

00:13:03.850 --> 00:13:06.060
Where the hell does he think he can go?!

00:13:06.060 --> 00:13:07.390
He's a shut-in otaku!

00:13:08.850 --> 00:13:10.970
<i>The number you are trying to reach 
is currently not available.</i>

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:12.620
Shit! He has his phone off!

00:13:12.620 --> 00:13:13.600
That little brat!

00:13:13.600 --> 00:13:16.230
Getting so upset over something so stupid!

00:13:21.920 --> 00:13:24.650
<i>This thing has really blown up, hasn't it?</i>

00:13:25.880 --> 00:13:28.070
<i>If it were just my problem, I wouldn't care.</i>

00:13:28.070 --> 00:13:30.680
<i>But I've made trouble for Izumi, too...</i>

00:13:31.440 --> 00:13:34.620
<i>The president ordered me not 
to text Izumi for a while,</i>

00:13:35.590 --> 00:13:37.080
<i>so I guess I'll have to apologize later.</i>

00:13:42.670 --> 00:13:43.540
Hello?

00:13:44.090 --> 00:13:46.300
Oh, Sagara-san! Thanks so much for yesterday!

00:13:47.070 --> 00:13:48.760
What? Izumi-kun is...

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:56.640
Sure, I understand.

00:13:57.030 --> 00:13:59.300
I'll contact you immediately 
if I hear something.

00:14:01.230 --> 00:14:02.350
Izumi...

00:14:03.070 --> 00:14:05.190
I'll go search for him, too!

00:14:10.260 --> 00:14:11.320
Izumi!

00:14:14.450 --> 00:14:16.270
Sorry for coming over so suddenly.

00:14:16.840 --> 00:14:19.940
Your address was in your 
email contact info.

00:14:19.940 --> 00:14:21.960
That's totally fine!

00:14:21.960 --> 00:14:24.210
More importantly, what happened?

00:14:26.470 --> 00:14:28.430
W-Well, just come on in for now.

00:14:28.430 --> 00:14:32.100
<b>GLOOOOM</b>

00:14:29.280 --> 00:14:30.850
Thanks for having me...

00:14:33.430 --> 00:14:34.260
Oh, yeah.

00:14:34.880 --> 00:14:36.890
Sagara-san just called me.

00:14:37.610 --> 00:14:39.770
I'd better let him know you're over here.

00:14:39.770 --> 00:14:40.750
You can't!

00:14:40.750 --> 00:14:42.270
You absolutely can't tell Rei I'm here!

00:14:44.440 --> 00:14:45.590
Please!

00:14:47.320 --> 00:14:48.450
Izumi...

00:14:51.410 --> 00:14:53.120
Do you smell something?

00:14:53.280 --> 00:14:55.540
<b><i>sniff
sniff</i></b>

00:14:54.560 --> 00:14:55.540
Oh, yeah.

00:14:55.880 --> 00:14:57.730
I fell into a pile of garbage earlier.

00:14:58.640 --> 00:15:00.370
A bath! You need a bath!

00:15:00.740 --> 00:15:03.460
Leave your clothes in the laundry basket!

00:15:03.460 --> 00:15:05.780
I'll bring you a change of clothes in a bit!

00:15:06.200 --> 00:15:07.090
Okay.

00:15:09.910 --> 00:15:12.180
<i>Now, then. What to do?</i>

00:15:13.190 --> 00:15:15.940
<i>I'm thrilled that Izumi 
came to visit me at home,</i>

00:15:15.940 --> 00:15:17.890
<i>but he's obviously really 
upset about something.</i>

00:15:18.210 --> 00:15:21.600
<i>And why did Izumi run away 
from home in the first place?</i>

00:15:22.780 --> 00:15:24.880
<i>I bet Sagara-san could 
tell me if I asked him.</i>

00:15:24.880 --> 00:15:26.750
<i>Wait, I can't!</i>

00:15:26.750 --> 00:15:28.610
<i>Izumi asked me not to.</i>

00:15:29.560 --> 00:15:30.920
<i>There's no choice.</i>

00:15:30.920 --> 00:15:31.980
<i>Once he's done with his bath,</i>

00:15:31.980 --> 00:15:33.570
<i>I've got to get him to talk to me.</i>

00:15:34.880 --> 00:15:37.910
Izumi! I'm leaving some clothes for you!

00:15:39.970 --> 00:15:43.120
<i>I should probably wash his clothes, too.</i>

00:15:46.080 --> 00:15:49.590
<i>That's right, Izumi was 
holding this envelope.</i>

00:15:52.110 --> 00:15:54.090
<i>He's really quiet in there.</i>

00:15:54.760 --> 00:15:55.940
Izumi?

00:15:58.700 --> 00:15:59.270
<i>It couldn't be!</i>

00:15:59.540 --> 00:16:00.970
<i>Has something happened to him?!</i>

00:16:02.280 --> 00:16:02.940
Izumi!

00:16:04.200 --> 00:16:05.400
He's asleep?!

00:16:06.800 --> 00:16:08.110
And he's drowning?!

00:16:08.470 --> 00:16:09.560
Izumi, wake up!

00:16:09.560 --> 00:16:10.320
You'll die like this!

00:16:14.440 --> 00:16:17.580
Huh? Why am I taking a bath?

00:16:18.280 --> 00:16:21.160
You took your clothes off and 
got in yourself, didn't you?

00:16:21.670 --> 00:16:23.850
Then... are you peeping at me, Ryouma?

00:16:23.850 --> 00:16:24.960
No!

00:16:25.200 --> 00:16:27.610
You were drowning just now!

00:16:28.080 --> 00:16:29.010
Oh...

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:32.130
Hot!

00:16:32.130 --> 00:16:34.590
<b>Catch me if you can!                                                  Wait!</b>

00:16:36.600 --> 00:16:38.470
<i>I-I saw it...</i>

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:40.590
<i>What do I do now?</i>

00:16:40.590 --> 00:16:42.980
<i>I know I have rational 
thought in me somewhere...</i>

00:16:43.960 --> 00:16:45.120
Ryouma?

00:16:45.120 --> 00:16:45.690
Eh?

00:16:47.050 --> 00:16:48.820
Hey, where's my underwear?

00:16:49.250 --> 00:16:51.320
<i>Boyfriend shirt!</i>

00:16:52.330 --> 00:16:54.990
<i>And he even said "where's 
my underwear?", meaning...</i>

00:16:55.710 --> 00:16:57.010
<i>Commando!</i>

00:16:57.490 --> 00:16:59.120
No! I'll die of <i>moe!</i>

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:00.700
Come on, where's my underwear?

00:17:00.740 --> 00:17:02.700
<b>Come on.</b>

00:17:01.370 --> 00:17:02.700
<b>Where's my 
underwear?</b>

00:17:03.360 --> 00:17:05.510
Sorry! I didn't have any brand-new ones here.

00:17:05.510 --> 00:17:07.860
I'll go buy some right now!

00:17:07.860 --> 00:17:09.990
What? You're going now?

00:17:10.370 --> 00:17:11.450
Never mind then.

00:17:11.450 --> 00:17:12.710
I'm going to bed.

00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:13.920
Eh? You're staying over?

00:17:24.590 --> 00:17:26.230
<i>What is this?!</i>

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:28.190
<i>My crush is in my house, sleeping in my bed!</i>

00:17:28.190 --> 00:17:30.480
<i>And he's not even wearing any underwear!</i>

00:17:36.910 --> 00:17:41.270
<i>What kind of test is this, God?</i>

00:17:48.800 --> 00:17:50.420
Good morning!

00:17:50.840 --> 00:17:52.020
Good morning...

00:17:52.480 --> 00:17:54.960
Sagara-san! You sure are early!

00:17:55.550 --> 00:17:57.280
Or, did you stay over?

00:17:58.800 --> 00:18:00.500
Yes. A bit.

00:18:00.390 --> 00:18:01.510
<b>Two all-nighters
 in a row.</b>

00:18:03.050 --> 00:18:04.470
Look at the time!

00:18:04.470 --> 00:18:06.030
I'd better get to the shoot!

00:18:10.900 --> 00:18:13.360
<i>In the end, he didn't come back.</i>

00:18:13.360 --> 00:18:15.040
<i>He hasn't contacted us.</i>

00:18:15.040 --> 00:18:19.480
<i>And the bag I had my tracker in
 was left at Kadoyama Shoten.</i>

00:18:19.480 --> 00:18:21.850
<i>His wallet was still in there,</i>

00:18:21.850 --> 00:18:24.410
<i>so he couldn't have stayed at a hotel.</i>

00:18:25.160 --> 00:18:28.920
<i>And the only friend he could've asked 
to stay with is Ichijou Ryouma.</i>

00:18:29.130 --> 00:18:31.460
<i>But there's been no word from Ryouma either.</i>

00:18:35.080 --> 00:18:37.860
<i>This is bad. I need to find him fast, or—</i>

00:18:38.250 --> 00:18:39.580
Izumi!

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:48.890
murmur
murmur

00:18:39.580 --> 00:18:41.520
My sweet Izumi is missing!

00:18:41.520 --> 00:18:44.990
He's so incredibly cute, someone 
must have kidnapped him!

00:18:44.990 --> 00:18:46.350
We have to call the police!

00:18:46.350 --> 00:18:48.890
We have to get word out to the entire 
world via my blog and Twitter!

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:51.550
We can't! I have to do something!

00:18:52.210 --> 00:18:54.020
<i>The number you are trying 
to reach is currently—</i>

00:18:54.020 --> 00:18:55.820
He still has his phone off?!

00:18:55.820 --> 00:18:57.740
That shitty little brat!

00:19:01.420 --> 00:19:03.060
All right! Done!

00:19:05.180 --> 00:19:06.690
Good morning, Izumi!

00:19:06.690 --> 00:19:08.440
Breakfast is ready!

00:19:10.780 --> 00:19:12.890
Hey, wake up, now.

00:19:13.730 --> 00:19:15.380
I'm still sleepy...

00:19:15.910 --> 00:19:16.760
Oh, boy.

00:19:16.760 --> 00:19:17.920
I guess I've got no choice.

00:19:18.860 --> 00:19:20.630
Here you go. Café au lait!

00:19:20.630 --> 00:19:21.510
It'll wake you up.

00:19:31.280 --> 00:19:33.820
I've got to head out for work soon.

00:19:33.820 --> 00:19:35.400
What will you do?

00:19:37.600 --> 00:19:41.180
I... don't want to go home yet.

00:19:43.150 --> 00:19:44.850
Did something happen?

00:19:44.850 --> 00:19:46.080
You can tell me.

00:19:48.850 --> 00:19:53.040
I took the manga I was 
drawing to the publisher.

00:19:54.190 --> 00:19:55.580
And they...

00:19:56.200 --> 00:19:57.180
said...

00:19:57.720 --> 00:20:00.030
I have no talent...

00:20:00.480 --> 00:20:02.950
After all the help you gave me...

00:20:03.710 --> 00:20:04.860
I'm sorry.

00:20:05.590 --> 00:20:06.470
Izumi...

00:20:07.120 --> 00:20:10.840
I worked so hard, dreaming 
of becoming a manga artist

00:20:10.840 --> 00:20:12.830
like Saotome-sensei...

00:20:12.830 --> 00:20:14.480
Saotome-sensei?

00:20:14.940 --> 00:20:18.350
They're the author of <i>Magical Angel Lala-Lulu</i>, 
which runs in <i>Monthly HIMICO</i> Magazine!

00:20:18.350 --> 00:20:19.840
I admire them so much!

00:20:19.840 --> 00:20:23.660
It even has an anime, 
which airs Sunday mornings at 7:30!

00:20:20.640 --> 00:20:22.950
<i>He's suddenly so energetic...</i>

00:20:24.640 --> 00:20:25.650
But now,

00:20:26.140 --> 00:20:28.300
that dream is...

00:20:28.300 --> 00:20:29.450
What are you saying?

00:20:29.450 --> 00:20:31.880
Izumi, you worked so hard!

00:20:31.880 --> 00:20:32.710
You can't give up now!

00:20:38.850 --> 00:20:39.990
Okay, then.

00:20:40.470 --> 00:20:43.590
You can stay here until you figure this out.

00:20:44.170 --> 00:20:47.290
But you need to promise me one thing!

00:20:47.710 --> 00:20:50.150
Call your family right now.

00:20:50.150 --> 00:20:51.060
I don't wanna!

00:20:51.300 --> 00:20:52.100
Huh?

00:20:52.300 --> 00:20:55.810
I don't wanna! Especially not Rei! 
I absolutely, 100% don't want to!

00:20:56.220 --> 00:20:58.120
If Rei hears what happened...

00:20:58.120 --> 00:21:00.210
Hmph! Just as I predicted!

00:21:00.210 --> 00:21:03.260
...he'll make that "I-told-you-so" face!

00:21:03.260 --> 00:21:06.160
Even so, you can't stay away forever.

00:21:06.160 --> 00:21:06.990
Yes, I can!

00:21:07.490 --> 00:21:10.490
I'll join your family and 
stay here with you forever!

00:21:10.960 --> 00:21:12.200
Stay with me forever?

00:21:12.200 --> 00:21:14.080
That's right, forever!

00:21:21.170 --> 00:21:23.460
Izumi, have you forgotten?

00:21:23.980 --> 00:21:26.430
I'm in love with you.

00:21:26.980 --> 00:21:28.810
How long do you think I can endure 
having you right in front of me,

00:21:28.810 --> 00:21:30.390
and keep myself from touching you?!

00:21:30.700 --> 00:21:32.390
I'm not that strong a person!

00:21:33.940 --> 00:21:35.390
Ryouma...

00:21:42.700 --> 00:21:43.730
Go ahead.

00:21:43.730 --> 00:21:44.110
Huh?

00:23:21.040 --> 00:23:21.850
Did you forget something?

00:23:21.850 --> 00:23:23.500
Don't you dare mock my feelings!

00:23:23.500 --> 00:23:24.250
Is that about right?

00:23:24.250 --> 00:23:25.770
Didn't you hear me?

00:23:25.770 --> 00:23:26.930
Hang in there, Rei!

00:23:26.930 --> 00:23:28.420
Give me five minutes! No, just one minute!

00:23:28.420 --> 00:23:31.220
I believe in Izumi-kun-lulu!

00:23:32.180 --> 00:23:34.510
Could this be...

00:23:32.180 --> 00:23:35.010
<b><i>Could This Be...</i></b>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>This is the cast of my 
beloved Saotome-sensei's 
manga, <i>Magical Angel
 Lala-Lulu!</i> Lala-Lulu, 
I love you!!</b>
